peasant: harvest failed: session 1111... could not be looked up in all sources, so nothing was recorded
  what:     this session-scoped harvest looked for session 1111...; no source that was searched holds it, and the lookup in opencode failed
  why:      the store has no row for this id, and the opencode lookup could not run, so the session may be there
  where:    session lookup (ingest scoped locate)
  when:     before any session was swept, recorded, or indexed
  searched:
    store         no recorded session with this id
    claude-code   not enabled (config.yaml excludes it); enable it with `peasant --config '/sandbox/config/peasant/config.yaml' --config-dir '/sandbox/config' --data-dir '/sandbox/data' --state-dir '/sandbox/state' kickstart`
    codex         not enabled (config.yaml excludes it); enable it with `peasant --config '/sandbox/config/peasant/config.yaml' --config-dir '/sandbox/config' --data-dir '/sandbox/data' --state-dir '/sandbox/state' kickstart`
    opencode      lookup failed: the OpenCode lookup for session 11111111-2222-4333-8444-555566667777 could not read database "/sandbox/opencode/opencode.db"
    cursor        not enabled (config.yaml excludes it); enable it with `peasant --config '/sandbox/config/peasant/config.yaml' --config-dir '/sandbox/config' --data-dir '/sandbox/data' --state-dir '/sandbox/state' kickstart`
    strike        not enabled (config.yaml excludes it); enable it with `peasant --config '/sandbox/config/peasant/config.yaml' --config-dir '/sandbox/config' --data-dir '/sandbox/data' --state-dir '/sandbox/state' kickstart`
    pi            not enabled (config.yaml excludes it); enable it with `peasant --config '/sandbox/config/peasant/config.yaml' --config-dir '/sandbox/config' --data-dir '/sandbox/data' --state-dir '/sandbox/state' kickstart`
  impact:   no session was recorded or changed. Start-up maintenance (recovery of interrupted writes,
            store migration, search-index repair) may still have run. No full scan was run.
  fix:      repair the opencode database at
            /sandbox/opencode/opencode.db
            (its lookup failed: the OpenCode lookup for session 11111111-2222-4333-8444-555566667777
            could not read database
            "/sandbox/opencode/opencode.db"),
            then run
            `peasant --config '/sandbox/config/peasant/config.yaml' --config-dir '/sandbox/config' --data-dir '/sandbox/data' --state-dir '/sandbox/state' harvest --session 11111111-2222-4333-8444-555566667777`
            again, or check the id with
            `peasant --config '/sandbox/config/peasant/config.yaml' --config-dir '/sandbox/config' --data-dir '/sandbox/data' --state-dir '/sandbox/state' sessions list`
